0..57 Comment "//! This fixture defines an inductive-recursive universe."
58..61 Comment "//!"
62..101 Comment "//! Each code has a decoded value type."
102..105 Comment "//!"
106..181 Comment "//! Recursive functions descend through codes and values. A fixpoint over a"
182..262 Comment "//! universe stages the code. A list tail stands at the list code itself. So the"
263..329 Comment "//! descent of a tail is the descent of the list, not of the code."
330..333 Comment "//!"
334..409 Comment "//! Limits: a direct tail call at the same code is refused in the twin. The"
410..470 Comment "//! stage that a decode needs to carry is refused there too."
471..474 Comment "//!"
475..531 Comment "//! - see: `pathological/universe/decoded-descent.gandr`"
533..579 Comment "// The naturals, their addition and the lists."
